## Interface: 16001
## Title: Tazu's Addon
## Notes: The do-everything Shaman companion for WoW Forever: spec-aware rotation help, a Shaman bar (weapon imbue, Smart Shock, Smart Heal and Fire Nova buttons, shield, totem-set and Stoneform hints), PvP mode, talents, gear tips, Horde and Alliance (Dwarf) leveling, totem class quests, reminders and Learn the Shaman.
